---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import RailIndex from '../components/RailIndex.astro';

// Os títulos têm de bater LITERALMENTE com os <h2> do corpo — checagem 22.
const sections = [
  { id: 'stance', title: 'Where this site stands' },
  { id: 'help', title: 'Free, confidential help' },
  { id: 'blocking', title: 'Blocking yourself' },
  { id: 'signs', title: 'Signs worth taking seriously' },
];
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Responsible gambling — mazetick"
  description="18+ only. Where to get free, confidential help with gambling in the UK and Ireland, and how to block yourself from betting sites."
>
  <header class="mast">
    <p class="mono kicker">18+ only</p>
    <h1 class="display title">Responsible gambling</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="spread">
    <div class="body">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          <strong>This site is for people aged 18 or over.</strong> Gambling can be
          addictive. It should never be treated as a way to make money, and nothing
          published here should be read as encouragement to bet.
        </p>

        <h2 id="stance">Where this site stands</h2>
        <p>
          mazetick publishes measurements. We do not sell selections, we do not promise a
          return, and we have published our own attempts to beat the market together with
          the evidence that they failed. The most useful thing we have measured is that{" "}
          <a href="/research/backing-the-favourite">a bet that wins 78.8% of the time
          still loses money</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 id="help">Free, confidential help</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>National Gambling Helpline</strong> — 0808 8020 133, free and open
            24 hours, run by <a href="https://www.gamcare.org.uk/" rel="noopener noreferrer external" target="_blank">GamCare</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.begambleaware.org/" rel="noopener noreferrer external" target="_blank">BeGambleAware</a>
            — advice, self-assessment and a directory of local support.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.gamblersanonymous.org.uk/" rel="noopener noreferrer external" target="_blank">Gamblers Anonymous</a>
            — group meetings across the UK, in person and online.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Ireland:</strong>
            <a href="https://www.problemgambling.ie/" rel="noopener noreferrer external" target="_blank">Problem Gambling Ireland</a>{" "}
            and the HSE drugs and alcohol helpline on 1800 459 459.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="blocking">Blocking yourself</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.gamstop.co.uk/" rel="noopener noreferrer external" target="_blank">GAMSTOP</a>
            — one free registration blocks you from every online operator licensed in
            Great Britain, for six months, one year or five years.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://gambleaware.ie/gambling-self-exclusion/" rel="noopener noreferrer external" target="_blank">Gamble Aware Ireland</a>
            — self-exclusion routes for Irish operators.
          </li>
          <li>
            Blocking software such as{" "}
            <a href="https://gamban.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer external" target="_blank">Gamban</a>{" "}
            covers apps and sites across your own devices.
          </li>
          <li>
            Most UK banks will block gambling transactions on your card at your request,
            usually from the banking app, often with a delay before it can be lifted.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="signs">Signs worth taking seriously</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Betting more than you set out to, or more than you can afford to lose.</li>
          <li>Chasing losses with bigger stakes.</li>
          <li>Borrowing, selling things, or hiding what you have staked from people close to you.</li>
          <li>Feeling anxious, irritable or low when you are not betting.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>If any of that is familiar, the helpline above is free and does not judge.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/*
      A margem repete o número da linha de apoio de propósito. É a única
      duplicação deliberada do site: numa página sobre dano do jogo, a
      informação que tem de estar visível sem rolar é o telefone, não o índice.
    */}
    <aside class="rail">
      <div class="rail-block">
        <span class="rail-label">National Gambling Helpline</span>
        <p class="rail-note">
          <strong>0808 8020 133</strong> &mdash; free, confidential, open 24 hours.
        </p>
      </div>
      <RailIndex items={sections} />
    </aside>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
